        <mxCell id="c119" value="&lt;i&gt;Selected: B5, whose formula shows in the bar; B6 uses the same SUMIFS on CreditMemoLine. Outlined: the count of lookups not matched, zero. Net revenue is billed less credits, in bold. The last row moves each of the 2026 credits to the quarter of its invoice and leaves out the 14 credit memos for invoices of earlier years, all dated in January (13,289.90 of Furniture credits).&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="456" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
